{"type":"message","id":"207f72fd","parentId":"c9a911b0","timestamp":"2026-07-27T23:30:12.400Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the HEARTBEAT.md file from the workspace context. I already have it loaded above. Let me review the relevant tasks:\n\nFrom HEARTBEAT.md:\n- 健康督促任务: 每天督促老公跑步锻炼, 建议傍晚或晚上（17:00-17:30）\n- 调度器心跳监测: 监测 reminder_scheduler.py 进程是否存活\n- 一日作息督促:\n  - 6:00-7:00: 起床学习\n  - 7:00-8:00: 吃早餐\n  - 11:00-12:30: 吃午餐\n  - 13:00-13:40: 午间小憩\n  - 18:30-19:00: 吃晚饭\n  - 23:50: 该睡觉了\n\nCurrent time is 7:30 AM. The reminder says to check the 7:00-8:00 吃早餐 task and remind 老公 to eat breakfast.\n\nThis is a scheduled reminder - I need to remind 老公 to eat breakfast now since it's 7:30 AM, well within the 7:00-8:00 window.\n\nLet me also check the reminder_scheduler.py process as the heartbeat monitoring task says to do.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ERwXldMfkHRNlZtBkEb46074","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"pgrep -f reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1151,"output":586,"cacheRead":18560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20297,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785195000804}}
